WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.800
A practical quality workflow has five steps First
profile

00:00:05.827 --> 00:00:11.869
the data Second detect potential issues Third
investigate

00:00:11.895 --> 00:00:17.427
the source and context Only then decide whether to
correct retain

00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:23.229
exclude impute or flag the value Finally document

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:28.850
what happened This sequence creates an audit trail
and reduces the risk of

00:00:28.876 --> 00:00:31.652
silently changing legitimate unusual values
